. * REM: a raw, timestamped event stream
. clear

. input sender receiver t

        sender   receiver          t
  1. 1 2 1
  2. 1 3 2
  3. 2 1 3
  4. 1 2 4
  5. 3 2 5
  6. 2 3 6
  7. 1 3 7
  8. 3 1 8
  9. 2 1 9
 10. 1 3 10
 11. end

. nwset sender receiver, directed eventtime(t) name(chat)

. nwrem chat, nodsnd nidrec
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
